	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Clarissime d. <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, nuper per postam allate sunt quędam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ad me literę dominationi t[uae] in[s]criptę a <persName ref="p6">Ioanne Abelo</persName>, quas libenter <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>statim ad te misissem, si nuncci copiam habuissem, adeoque pauc<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>orum dierum moram defectui nuncci imputes, rogo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>de matrimonio regine nihildum certi habeo; filius <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName>Suetie</placeName> regis reversus est ad patrem et, ut audio, prudentia, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>modestia et liberalitate sua apud omnes regni Anglię <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ordines laudem non vulgarem meritus est.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName>Imperatoris</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>legatus adhuc in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> commanet; verum, quid effecturus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>sit, ignoro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Galli iniqua et superba dominatione <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>premunt et adfligunt, tametsi <placeName ref="l2524">Scoti</placeName> nihil facere recusent <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eorum, quę ex pacto et more reginę sue debent; verum evan<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>gelii susceptio et professio huius dissidii fons et origo est.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Quem deus finem <persName>Gallicę</persName> persecutionis daturus sit, magna <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>apud omnes expectatio est.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l875">Hispania</placeName> nuper in duobus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>suppliciis centum viginti quatuor combusti sunt, et cum rex <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>huiuscemodi bonorum virorum internecionem detestaretur <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>velletque concilium nationis cogere, inquisitores et papistę ei <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>denunciarunt non deberi ea in novam deliberationem et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>disputationem reduci, que olim consiliorum generalium authoritate <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et censura condemnata essent; parentem suum <persName>Carolum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>lenitate et mollitia Lutheranos insolentiores fecisse et fovisse; hęc <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>immedicabilia et corrumpentia membra ense resecta oportuit<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. Ovid (gemäß Proverbia sententiaeque Latinitatis medii aevi. Lateinische Sprichwörter und Sentenzen des Mittelalters in alphabetischer Anordnung, gesammelt und hg. v. Hans Walther).</note> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>iam olim, et si parentem a suspitione levare velit, gladio et igne <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>huic contagio occurendum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l15">Antwerpię</placeName> crudelis quoque sęvitia exer<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>cetur in pios et modo submerguntur, ut lignis parcatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Queso, ut me <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>commendes <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martiri</persName> tuoque genero; mea erga vos offitia perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>constabunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentine</placeName> 20. februarii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p8121">Christophorus Montius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Imperator modo <placeName ref="l66">Wratislavie</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">in <placeName ref="l66">Breslau</placeName>.</note> esse dicitur pro mat<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>rimonio</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>